-- g1-tests-adverse.l4: tests of g1-adverse-action.l4 (s.10).  Group G1.  Generated from a table of scenarios kept in the encoder's
-- work directory (not part of the deposit); the assertions below are the record of the expected values, decided from s.10 and from IL s.10 before any rule was run.
-- Where several preconditions are missing at once the Law does not rank them, so those cases assert the number of unmet
-- preconditions and each one by membership, and only single-miss cases assert a whole list.

§ `Tests of s.10`

