#ASSERT NOT `the Registrar may suspend the licence until final judgment` `a suspension without consultation`
#ASSERT `the preconditions of section 10(b) not met` `a suspension after a consultation whose advice was not valid` EQUALS (LIST `the Council's advice was not validly given under section 10`)
