#ASSERT `a suspension under section 10(b) is in force on the day` (YMD 2026 5 1) (JUST (YMD 2027 6 10)) (YMD 2027 6 10)
#ASSERT NOT `a suspension under section 10(b) is in force on the day` (YMD 2026 5 1) (JUST (YMD 2027 6 10)) (YMD 2027 6 11)
-- The reading where "until" stops short of the day of the judgment.
