#ASSERT NOT `a suspension under section 10(b) is in force on the day, ending before the day of the judgment` (YMD 2026 5 1) (JUST (YMD 2027 6 10)) (YMD 2027 6 10)
#ASSERT `a suspension under section 10(b) is in force on the day, ending before the day of the judgment` (YMD 2026 5 1) NOTHING (YMD 2035 1 1)
