§§ `s.10(c): a curable defect, the direction not to do specified work`

`a direction on a curable ground 6 defect` MEANS `Circumstances of a direction under section 10(c)` WITH
    `the grounds` IS `only ground 6`
    `the Registrar holds that the defect can be cured` IS TRUE
    `the Council was consulted` IS TRUE
    `the Council's advice was validly given` IS TRUE

`a direction with no defect` MEANS `Circumstances of a direction under section 10(c)` WITH
    `the grounds` IS `no ground`
    `the Registrar holds that the defect can be cured` IS TRUE
    `the Council was consulted` IS TRUE
    `the Council's advice was validly given` IS TRUE

`a direction on a defect held not curable` MEANS `Circumstances of a direction under section 10(c)` WITH
    `the grounds` IS `only ground 3`
    `the Registrar holds that the defect can be cured` IS FALSE
    `the Council was consulted` IS TRUE
    `the Council's advice was validly given` IS TRUE

`a direction without consultation` MEANS `Circumstances of a direction under section 10(c)` WITH
    `the grounds` IS `only ground 3`
    `the Registrar holds that the defect can be cured` IS TRUE
    `the Council was consulted` IS FALSE
    `the Council's advice was validly given` IS FALSE

`a direction after a consultation whose advice was not valid` MEANS `Circumstances of a direction under section 10(c)` WITH
    `the grounds` IS `only ground 3`
    `the Registrar holds that the defect can be cured` IS TRUE
    `the Council was consulted` IS TRUE
    `the Council's advice was validly given` IS FALSE

