§§ `s.10(c): the cure period (P12, kind D): IL s.10(c) applied, and the alternative`

`a cure period of 30 days from 1 January 2026` MEANS `Period fixed by the Registrar under section 10` WITH `the number of units` IS 30, `the unit` IS `a number of days fixed under section 10`, `counted from the day` IS YMD 2026 1 1
`a cure period of 4 weeks from 1 January 2026` MEANS `Period fixed by the Registrar under section 10` WITH `the number of units` IS 4, `the unit` IS `a number of weeks fixed under section 10`, `counted from the day` IS YMD 2026 1 1
`a cure period of 1 month from 31 January 2026` MEANS `Period fixed by the Registrar under section 10` WITH `the number of units` IS 1, `the unit` IS `a number of months fixed under section 10`, `counted from the day` IS YMD 2026 1 31
`a cure period of 6 months from 31 August 2025` MEANS `Period fixed by the Registrar under section 10` WITH `the number of units` IS 6, `the unit` IS `a number of months fixed under section 10`, `counted from the day` IS YMD 2025 8 31
`a cure period of 1 year from 29 February 2024` MEANS `Period fixed by the Registrar under section 10` WITH `the number of units` IS 1, `the unit` IS `a number of years fixed under section 10`, `counted from the day` IS YMD 2024 2 29
`a period of 90 days from 1 January 2026` MEANS `Period fixed by the Registrar under section 10` WITH `the number of units` IS 90, `the unit` IS `a number of days fixed under section 10`, `counted from the day` IS YMD 2026 1 1
`a period of 2 years from 15 March 2026` MEANS `Period fixed by the Registrar under section 10` WITH `the number of units` IS 2, `the unit` IS `a number of years fixed under section 10`, `counted from the day` IS YMD 2026 3 15
`no days of rest at all` MEANS `Calendar of rest days` WITH `days of rest, recess or holiday` IS EMPTY
`a calendar with 31 January 2026 a day of rest` MEANS `Calendar of rest days` WITH `days of rest, recess or holiday` IS LIST YMD 2026 1 31
`a calendar with 28 February 2026 a day of rest` MEANS `Calendar of rest days` WITH `days of rest, recess or holiday` IS LIST YMD 2026 2 28
`a calendar with 15 March 2028 a day of rest` MEANS `Calendar of rest days` WITH `days of rest, recess or holiday` IS LIST YMD 2028 3 15

-- IL s.10(a) and (b): the day of the direction is not counted; months and years end on the same-numbered day or the month's last day.
#ASSERT `the last day of the cure period under section 10(c)` `a cure period of 30 days from 1 January 2026` `no days of rest at all` EQUALS YMD 2026 1 31
#ASSERT `the last day of the cure period under section 10(c)` `a cure period of 4 weeks from 1 January 2026` `no days of rest at all` EQUALS YMD 2026 1 29
#ASSERT `the last day of the cure period under section 10(c)` `a cure period of 1 month from 31 January 2026` `no days of rest at all` EQUALS YMD 2026 2 28
