#ASSERT `the last day of the cure period under section 10(c)` `a cure period of 1 year from 29 February 2024` `no days of rest at all` EQUALS YMD 2025 2 28
-- IL s.10(c) applied: a last day that is a day of rest moves to the next day that is not one.
#ASSERT `the last day of the cure period under section 10(c)` `a cure period of 30 days from 1 January 2026` `a calendar with 31 January 2026 a day of rest` EQUALS YMD 2026 2 1
#ASSERT `the last day of the cure period under section 10(c)` `a cure period of 1 month from 31 January 2026` `a calendar with 28 February 2026 a day of rest` EQUALS YMD 2026 3 1
#ASSERT `the last day of the cure period under section 10(c)` `a cure period of 4 weeks from 1 January 2026` `a calendar with 31 January 2026 a day of rest` EQUALS YMD 2026 1 29
