#ASSERT `the last day of the cure period under section 10(c), without IL s 10(c)` `a cure period of 30 days from 1 January 2026` EQUALS YMD 2026 1 31
#ASSERT `the last day of the cure period under section 10(c), without IL s 10(c)` `a cure period of 4 weeks from 1 January 2026` EQUALS YMD 2026 1 29
#ASSERT `the last day of the cure period under section 10(c), without IL s 10(c)` `a cure period of 1 month from 31 January 2026` EQUALS YMD 2026 2 28
#ASSERT `the last day of the cure period under section 10(c), without IL s 10(c)` `a cure period of 6 months from 31 August 2025` EQUALS YMD 2026 2 28
#ASSERT `the last day of the cure period under section 10(c), without IL s 10(c)` `a cure period of 1 year from 29 February 2024` EQUALS YMD 2025 2 28

