§§ `s.10(d): the bar after a revocation (P13, kind W): IL s.10(c) applied, and the alternative`

`a revocation with the Council consulted` MEANS `Circumstances of a bar after revocation under section 10(d)` WITH
    `the licence was revoked under section 10(a)` IS TRUE
    `the Council was consulted` IS TRUE
    `the Council's advice was validly given` IS TRUE

`a licence that was not revoked` MEANS `Circumstances of a bar after revocation under section 10(d)` WITH
    `the licence was revoked under section 10(a)` IS FALSE
    `the Council was consulted` IS TRUE
    `the Council's advice was validly given` IS TRUE

`a revocation without consulting the Council` MEANS `Circumstances of a bar after revocation under section 10(d)` WITH
    `the licence was revoked under section 10(a)` IS TRUE
    `the Council was consulted` IS FALSE
    `the Council's advice was validly given` IS FALSE

`a revocation after a consultation whose advice was not valid` MEANS `Circumstances of a bar after revocation under section 10(d)` WITH
    `the licence was revoked under section 10(a)` IS TRUE
    `the Council was consulted` IS TRUE
    `the Council's advice was validly given` IS FALSE

#ASSERT `the preconditions of section 10(d) for the bar not met` `a revocation with the Council consulted` EQUALS EMPTY
#ASSERT `the preconditions of section 10(d) for the bar not met` `a licence that was not revoked` EQUALS (LIST `the licence was not revoked under section 10(a)`)
#ASSERT `the preconditions of section 10(d) for the bar not met` `a revocation without consulting the Council` EQUALS (LIST `the Council was not consulted under section 10`)
#ASSERT `the preconditions of section 10(d) for the bar not met` `a revocation after a consultation whose advice was not valid` EQUALS (LIST `the Council's advice was not validly given under section 10`)
-- The direction is a duty ("shall direct") with no period: it stands.
#TRACE `s 10(d) — the Registrar must direct the period before a new application may be made` `a revocation with the Council consulted` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Registrar` DOES `fix the period before a new application may be made after a revocation` AT 9
-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 10(d) — the Registrar must direct the period before a new application may be made` `a revocation with the Council consulted` AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 400)
-- EXPECT: STANDING
#TRACE `s 10(d) — the Registrar must direct the period before a new application may be made` `a licence that was not revoked` AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 400)
-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
-- The additional conditions: a power that needs the revocation; the reading that it needs the consultation too.
#ASSERT `the Registrar may add conditions to the grant of a new licence` `a revocation with the Council consulted`
#ASSERT `the Registrar may add conditions to the grant of a new licence` `a revocation without consulting the Council`
#ASSERT NOT `the Registrar may add conditions to the grant of a new licence` `a licence that was not revoked`
#ASSERT `the Registrar may add conditions to the grant of a new licence, the Council consulted` `a revocation with the Council consulted`
#ASSERT NOT `the Registrar may add conditions to the grant of a new licence, the Council consulted` `a revocation without consulting the Council`
#ASSERT NOT `the Registrar may add conditions to the grant of a new licence, the Council consulted` `a licence that was not revoked`
#TRACE `s 10(d) — the Registrar may add conditions to the grant of a new licence` `a revocation with the Council consulted` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the Registrar` DOES `add conditions to the grant of a new licence` AT 9
-- EXPECT: FULFILLED
#TRACE `s 10(d) — the Registrar may add conditions to the grant of a new licence` `a licence that was not revoked` AT 0 WITH
    (`WAIT UNTIL` 9)
-- EXPECT: FULFILLED

#ASSERT `the last day of the bar under section 10(d)` `a period of 90 days from 1 January 2026` `no days of rest at all` EQUALS YMD 2026 4 1
#ASSERT `the last day of the bar under section 10(d)` `a period of 2 years from 15 March 2026` `no days of rest at all` EQUALS YMD 2028 3 15
#ASSERT `the last day of the bar under section 10(d)` `a period of 2 years from 15 March 2026` `a calendar with 15 March 2028 a day of rest` EQUALS YMD 2028 3 16
#ASSERT `the last day of the bar under section 10(d), without IL s 10(c)` `a period of 2 years from 15 March 2026` EQUALS YMD 2028 3 15
-- The window for a new application opens only AFTER the last day of the bar.
#ASSERT NOT `a new application may be made on the day after the bar` `a period of 2 years from 15 March 2026` `no days of rest at all` (YMD 2028 3 15)
#ASSERT `a new application may be made on the day after the bar` `a period of 2 years from 15 March 2026` `no days of rest at all` (YMD 2028 3 16)
#ASSERT NOT `a new application may be made on the day after the bar` `a period of 2 years from 15 March 2026` `a calendar with 15 March 2028 a day of rest` (YMD 2028 3 16)
#ASSERT `a new application may be made on the day after the bar` `a period of 2 years from 15 March 2026` `a calendar with 15 March 2028 a day of rest` (YMD 2028 3 17)
#ASSERT NOT `a new application may be made on the day after the bar, without IL s 10(c)` `a period of 2 years from 15 March 2026` (YMD 2028 3 15)
#ASSERT `a new application may be made on the day after the bar, without IL s 10(c)` `a period of 2 years from 15 March 2026` (YMD 2028 3 16)
-- Further training: the Registrar's requirement is an input; the condition is met if no training was required or it was completed, and every other condition was met.
`training required and completed` MEANS `Additional conditions under section 10(d)` WITH
    `further training the Registrar required` IS TRUE
    `the further training was completed` IS TRUE
    `the other additional conditions the Registrar fixed were met` IS TRUE
`training required and not completed` MEANS `Additional conditions under section 10(d)` WITH
    `further training the Registrar required` IS TRUE
    `the further training was completed` IS FALSE
    `the other additional conditions the Registrar fixed were met` IS TRUE
`no training required` MEANS `Additional conditions under section 10(d)` WITH
    `further training the Registrar required` IS FALSE
    `the further training was completed` IS FALSE
    `the other additional conditions the Registrar fixed were met` IS TRUE
`training done but another condition unmet` MEANS `Additional conditions under section 10(d)` WITH
    `further training the Registrar required` IS TRUE
    `the further training was completed` IS TRUE
    `the other additional conditions the Registrar fixed were met` IS FALSE
#ASSERT `the additional conditions of section 10(d) are met` `training required and completed`
#ASSERT NOT `the additional conditions of section 10(d) are met` `training required and not completed`
#ASSERT `the additional conditions of section 10(d) are met` `no training required`
#ASSERT NOT `the additional conditions of section 10(d) are met` `training done but another condition unmet`

§§ `s.10: revocation and suspension take a licence out of force`

`a licence never touched by section 10` MEANS Licence WITH
    `the holder` IS Person WITH `reference for the person` IS "p1", `kind of person` IS `an individual`
    `the kind of licence` IS `grade 2 licence`
    `a temporary licence under section 9` IS FALSE
    `granted on` IS YMD 2025 7 17
    `renewed on` IS EMPTY
    `validity ends on, as recorded` IS JUST (YMD 2030 3 31)
    `revoked on` IS NOTHING
    `suspended from` IS NOTHING
    `suspended until` IS NOTHING

`a licence revoked on 1 June 2026` MEANS Licence WITH
    `the holder` IS Person WITH `reference for the person` IS "p1", `kind of person` IS `an individual`
    `the kind of licence` IS `grade 2 licence`
    `a temporary licence under section 9` IS FALSE
    `granted on` IS YMD 2025 7 17
    `renewed on` IS EMPTY
    `validity ends on, as recorded` IS JUST (YMD 2030 3 31)
    `revoked on` IS JUST (YMD 2026 6 1)
    `suspended from` IS NOTHING
    `suspended until` IS NOTHING

`a licence suspended for the whole of July 2026` MEANS Licence WITH
    `the holder` IS Person WITH `reference for the person` IS "p1", `kind of person` IS `an individual`
    `the kind of licence` IS `grade 2 licence`
    `a temporary licence under section 9` IS FALSE
    `granted on` IS YMD 2025 7 17
    `renewed on` IS EMPTY
    `validity ends on, as recorded` IS JUST (YMD 2030 3 31)
    `revoked on` IS NOTHING
    `suspended from` IS JUST (YMD 2026 7 1)
    `suspended until` IS JUST (YMD 2026 7 31)

`a licence suspended from 1 July 2026 with no end fixed` MEANS Licence WITH
    `the holder` IS Person WITH `reference for the person` IS "p1", `kind of person` IS `an individual`
    `the kind of licence` IS `grade 2 licence`
    `a temporary licence under section 9` IS FALSE
    `granted on` IS YMD 2025 7 17
    `renewed on` IS EMPTY
    `validity ends on, as recorded` IS JUST (YMD 2030 3 31)
    `revoked on` IS NOTHING
    `suspended from` IS JUST (YMD 2026 7 1)
    `suspended until` IS NOTHING

